<p>Hi <%= @user.display_name %>,</p>
<p>You can now sign in to RecoveryBot with <strong><%= @provider %></strong>. It was linked to your account from Account settings.</p>
<p>If that wasn't you, unlink it and change your password in Account settings, and let us know through the Contact page.</p>
<p><a href="<%= @settings_url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 10px; background: #0b6ede; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">Open Account settings</a></p>
